<title>USA: Michael Baker unit wins Chicago contracts.</title>
<headline>Michael Baker unit wins Chicago contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baker Heavy and Highway Inc, a unit of Michael Baker Corp, said Thursday it was awarded two contracts from the city of Chicago with a combined value of $23.6 million.</p>
<p>The contracts are for rehabilitation services on the Cermak Road Bascule Bridge and the Chicago Skyway Bridge.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
